{"availability":"available","full":"TawfiqA05/reel-picks","name":"reel-picks","description":"Ranks what's playing at my AMC by critic scores and my own taste, and picks the four to see this week. Node, SQLite, installable PWA.","category":"Developer tools","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-08-23T22:29:54Z","updated":"2026-10-08T00:18:35Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://reel-picks-demo.up.railway.app","topics":["amc","express","javascript","movie-recommendations","movies","nodejs","pwa","recommender-system","sqlite","tmdb","tmdb-api"],"demo":"https://reel-picks-demo.up.railway.app/","color":"#193546","ink":"#a6d6e8","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-19T07:19:11.387Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-19T07:19:11.387Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-19T07:19:11.387Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-05T19:23:13.442Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-07T20:13:43.938Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-09T22:04:59.706Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-13T07:35:04.405Z","stars":0,"forks":0},{"at":"2026-10-19T07:19:11.387Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Node.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Try the demo: reel-picks-demo.up.railway.app. It runs on made-up people and made-up theaters with real films, and whatever you change there is yours alone and gone within the hour.","Reel Picks tells me which four movies to see each week at my AMC. I built it because my A-List membership gives me four tickets a week and I kept spending them on so-so films, or finding out too late that the one I wanted had left. It ranks everything playing by blending critic and audience scores with my own ratings, and picks the showtime that fits my evening.","The screenshots come from the demo, which runs on made-up people and made-up theaters with real films (see Demo mode below). Here it is in motion: Picks, What should I watch?, then a film it suggested."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/TawfiqA05/reel-picks/blob/main/READ